# Rescheduling through a session: due today and tomorrow keys, one day earlier and later with brackets, a typed +3d in the due prompt, a start date, and clearing a due date with an empty prompt.
file <<END
Chores:
	- Laundry @due({today-2})
	- Dishes
	- Taxes @due({today+10})
	- Vacuum
END
keys j } } }
see 󱙬 tomorrow
keys j T
see 󱙬 today
keys j {
keys md
see Due date
type +3d
keys <Enter>
keys j w ] [ [
keys k md
see Due date
keys <BS> <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
Chores:
	- Laundry @due({today+1})
	- Dishes @due({today})
	- Taxes
	- Vacuum @start({today})
END
